{"accountName": "火绒安全实验室", "author": "火绒安全实验室", "body": null, "content": [{"text": "火绒安全 2026-11-11 17:04 北京", "type": "p"}, {"text": "2026-11微软漏洞通告", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": 1, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/0icdicRft8tz7YryOyqjnU6PAcXanhfdAGKthMXstNQbqtq4gmiaAeDnnt9Ugmf8RJVlhvCY2PiciasicueJiam6HaicMg/0?wx_fmt=jpeg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "微软官方发布了2026年11月的安全更新。本月更新公布了1094个漏洞，包含535个特权提升漏洞、297个远程执行代码漏洞、156个信息泄露漏洞、46个拒绝服务漏洞、安全功能绕过漏洞27个、22个身份假冒漏洞、篡改漏洞11个，其中64个漏洞级别为“Critical”（高危），1029个为“Important”（严重）。 建议用户及时使用火绒安全软件(个人/企业)【漏洞修复】功能更新补丁。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "涉及组件", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".NET", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": true, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/u1Oy5xQ01SqcgSIfjNCztmZZGibDPPib31EjkBLCdP5kFCiaEJMMdQL4OdXOteAxLwgXEKHufg8ark8TyhGqVhtfiaUDUeWDDb8g7ia1xNXtqUm8/0?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "Active Directory Domain Services", "type": "p"}, {"text": "ActiveSyncProvider", "type": "p"}, {"text": "AMD Zen", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": true, "caption": "图片", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/0icdicRft8tz6JM0bptCnP8Sz8m18FwTnjZpNfzpuBuP9vsELIIuagZVLlKrRGvIhbOXNdf22pUC76WE0yxGUAmQ/640?wx_fmt=other&wxfrom=5&wx_lazy=1&wx_co=1&tp=webp#imgIndex=3", "type": "img"}, {"text": "ASP.NET Core", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Aspire", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Azure CLI", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Azure Confidential Clean Rooms", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Azure CycleCloud", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Azure DevOps", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Azure DevOps Server", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Azure File Sync", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Azure Firmware", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Azure Front Door (AFD)", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Azure Local", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Azure Managed Grafana", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Azure NFS mount helper (aznfs)", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Azure OpenAI", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Azure Pipelines", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Connected Devices Platform Service (Cdpsvc)", "type": "p"}, {"text":